{"id":"cbad89ba15","t":"The Detective Agency For Regretful Male Leads Is Now Open For Business!","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/neuralpony-193x278.jpg","n":67,"l":67,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business"},"u":1795038247379,"desc":"ي عالم الروايات الإلكترونية، البطلة ليست رومانسية أو قوية أو ذات قوى خارقة، بل تعمل كمحققة في مكتب تحريات! تتلقى طلبات غريبة من أبطال نادمين يطلبون منها البحث عن “بطلاتهم الهاربات”. وبينما لا تملك سوى 500 وون، تبدأ كل قضية بظهور المحقق الذي يعثر على البطلة المختفية. وبخبرتها في قراءة روايات الهروب، تتعقب البطلات وتعيدهن إلى أبطالهن—سواء كانوا جامدين أو متوحشين أو ندماء. هدفها: أن تمنح كل قصة نهايتها السعيدة، ولو كانت بدايتها فوضوية!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى"],"src":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-detective-agency-for-regretful-male-leads-is-now-open-for-business|/manga/the-detective-agency-for-regretf